# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: Product and Resource are disjoint.
#
# The two share the component level and differ in their role: a resource
# performs functions, a product is transformed by them. A thing that is both
# would transform itself.
@prefix aias:     <https://w3id.org/aias#> .
@prefix vdi3682:  <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#> .
@prefix iso7498:  <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#> .
@prefix iso22989: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#> .
@prefix ex:       <https://w3id.org/aias/example/neg#> .
@prefix owl:      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/neg02> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/2.0.0> .
ex:Thing2 a aias:Product , aias:Resource .
